0..88 Comment "/// This source checks a pair against a definition that returns a dependent record type."
89..92 Comment "///"
93..237 Comment "/// It pins the kernel\'s replay of that definition\'s unfolding. Before the fix, the kernel declined the unfolding, and the whole source faulted."
238..241 Comment "///"
242..471 Comment "/// The record\'s second field is a call stuck on the first field, and one of its arms calls another definition. The checker reads the unfolding to its normal form, and the kernel converts the two sides with definitions unfolding."
472..475 Comment "///"
476..492 Comment "/// - see: #2831"
493..509 Comment "/// - see: #2555"
